{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_097_florence_2-title\">Florence-2</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">核心不是增加多个 head，而是用任务提示和位置 token 将 caption、检测、grounding、分割全部改写为 seq2seq。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Reformulates captioning, object detection, phrase grounding, and segmentation into a single prompt-driven sequence-to-sequence generation task with quantized coordinate tokens.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像与任务提示，例如 caption、detect、ground 或 segment</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image + task-specific text prompt (e.g., &lt;OD&gt;, &lt;CAPTION&gt;, &lt;REFERRING_EXPRESSION_SEGMENTATION&gt;)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">文本、类别与量化位置 token 序列，后处理为描述、框或多边形</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Unified token sequence decoding text descriptions, class labels, and quantized 0–999 bounding-box or polygon coordinates</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2, section 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/html/Xiao_Florence-2_Advancing_a_Unified_Representation_for_a_Variety_of_Vision_Tasks_CVPR_2024_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_097_florence_2')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_097_florence_2')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Florence-2 original paper architecture figure, Figure 2, section 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/8e5f42588e09448468f2.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2, section 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_097_florence_2\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_097_florence_2')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_097_florence_2\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">所有视觉任务共享同一图像接口</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image + task-specific text prompt (e.g., &lt;od&gt;, &lt;caption&gt;, &lt;referring_expression_segmentation&gt;) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"所有视觉任务共享同一图像接口\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image + task-specific text prompt (e.g., &lt;od&gt;, &lt;caption&gt;, &lt;referring_expression_segmentation&gt;) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">所有视觉任务共享同一图像接口</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image + task-specific text prompt (e.g., &lt;od&gt;, &lt;caption&gt;, &lt;referring_expression_segmentation&gt;) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"特殊任务 token 指定描述、检测、定位或分割\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes prompt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"任务文本提示\" data-node-name-en=\"prompt\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务文本提示</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prompt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">特殊任务 token 指定描述、检测、定位或分割</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes prompt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"产生层级视觉 token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs DaViT vision encoder within the core prompted unified vision seq2seq computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"DaViT vision encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"DaViT vision encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>DaViT vision encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">产生层级视觉 token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs DaViT vision encoder within the core prompted unified vision seq2seq computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把视觉 token 对齐到语言维度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Linear projection + LayerNorm within the core prompted unified vision seq2seq computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Linear projection + LayerNorm\" data-node-name-en=\"Linear projection + LayerNorm\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Linear projection + LayerNorm</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把视觉 token 对齐到语言维度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Linear projection + LayerNorm within the core prompted unified vision seq2seq computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"拼接视觉 token 与提示 token 后联合编码\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs multimodal Transformer encoder within the core prompted unified vision seq2seq computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"多模态 Transformer encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"multimodal Transformer encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多模态 Transformer encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multimodal Transformer encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">拼接视觉 token 与提示 token 后联合编码</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs multimodal Transformer encoder within the core prompted unified vision seq2seq computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按统一词表逐 token 生成任务答案\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Transformer decoder within the core prompted unified vision seq2seq computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"自回归 Transformer decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Transformer decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">自回归 Transformer decoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Transformer decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按统一词表逐 token 生成任务答案</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Transformer decoder within the core prompted unified vision seq2seq computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"量化坐标 token 表示 box、quad 与 polygon 顶点\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 07 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"扩展位置词表\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">扩展位置词表</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">量化坐标 token 表示 box、quad 与 polygon 顶点</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 07 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把生成序列解析成 caption、检测框或分割多边形\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces unified token sequence decoding text descriptions, class labels, and quantized 0–999 bounding-box or polygon coordinates via Stage 08.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"任务后处理\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_097_florence_2', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务后处理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把生成序列解析成 caption、检测框或分割多边形</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces unified token sequence decoding text descriptions, class labels, and quantized 0–999 bounding-box or polygon coordinates via Stage 08.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Florence-2 Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 提示驱动的统一视觉任务序列生成</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Unified Task-Prompted Sequence-to-Sequence Generation Over Text &amp; Coordinate Tokens</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Florence-2：核心公式 · 提示驱动的统一视觉任务序列生成\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"97\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"28.658623pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.028346 -