_g24-115\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"215.602824\" xlink:href=\"#m097_g24-107\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"223.074804\" xlink:href=\"#m097_g24-111\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"228.056125\" xlink:href=\"#m097_g24-117\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"233.037445\" xlink:href=\"#m097_g24-116\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"235.807057\" xlink:href=\"#m097_g24-112\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"240.788377\" xlink:href=\"#m097_g24-117\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"245.769697\" xlink:href=\"#m097_g24-116\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"248.53931\" xlink:href=\"#m097_g10-186\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">视觉任务通常需要不同 head、标签格式和专用模型</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Multi-task vision systems required separate specialized task heads, loss functions, and architectural branches for boxes, masks, and text.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把检测、分割、描述与定位统一为基于提示的序列到序列任务</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Represent spatial coordinates as discrete vocabulary tokens (1,000 bins) so a single DaViT + seq2seq Transformer handles all vision tasks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以统一文本提示和位置 token 在多任务数据上训练单一生成模型</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Unified coordinate-token sequence interface + FLD-5B (5.4B multi-task annotations across 126M images) unified pretraining.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">可作为医学 VLM 的通用视觉接口和弱标注工具，但需领域适配</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Offers a unified promptable foundation interface adaptable to medical lesion detection, grounded reporting, and polygon annotation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">通用视觉基础模型前沿；医学细粒度定位和安全性尚未充分验证</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Frontier generalist vision interface; clinical precision on sub-millimeter boundaries and 3D volumes requires dedicated adaptation.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把多种视觉任务统一为由提示条件化的序列生成。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">视觉 token 与文本提示在 encoder 中融合，decoder 不依赖任务专属检测或分割头。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">坐标量化为词表 token，使文本与空间输出共享交叉熵目标。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Represent spatial coordinates as discrete vocabulary tokens (1,000 bins) so a single DaViT + seq2seq Transformer handles all vision tasks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Unified coordinate-token sequence interface + FLD-5B (5.4B multi-task annotations across 126M images) unified pretraining.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Unified Task-Prompted Sequence-to-Sequence Generation Over Text &amp; Coordinate Tokens.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可作为医学弱标注接口，把同一影像转成描述、框或区域草案。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">自然图像位置词表与训练分布不保证微小病灶或 3D 体积定位准确，需领域微调和逐任务校准。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Offers a unified promptable foundation interface adaptable to medical lesion detection, grounded reporting, and polygon annotation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Frontier generalist vision interface; clinical precision on sub-millimeter boundaries and 3D volumes requires dedicated adaptation.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/html/Xiao_Florence-2_Advancing_a_Unified_Representation_for_a_Variety_of_Vision_Tasks_CVPR_2024_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Florence-2: Advancing a Unified Representation for a Variety of Vision Tasks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/Florence-2\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}